# Files excluded from Vercel deployment upload.
# These remain on disk and render locally via `npm run dev`,
# but are not deployed to production.
#
# When excluding a page from prod, also add a redirect rule in vercel.json
# so the old URL 301s somewhere sensible.

# Retired: /ux-designer/* moved to /ux-design-skill/*.
# Old page source lives under src/pages/archive/ux-designer/ for local reference.
# Vercel never sees the archive folder; locally Astro serves it at /archive/ux-designer/*.
# Production /ux-designer/* requests are caught by vercel.json redirects.
src/pages/archive/
